    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.461,
      0.032,
      0.545,
      0.968
    ],
    "text": "Things Successful Test Takers Do",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-21:text-1",
    "page_id": 21,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.072,
      0.018,
      0.312,
      0.889
    ],
    "text": "\"Become a Projects and Talent Pipeline expert! Thatwas my least knowledgeable area before the certification, and now is the most valuable part of Recruiter for me.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-21:text-2",
    "page_id": 21,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.362,
      0.018,
      0.418,
      0.171
    ],
    "text": "\\- Peter Z.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-21:text-3",
    "page_id": 21,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.571,
      0.188,
      0.824,
      0.986
    ],
    "text": "“Take the training seriously and dedicate some   \nfocused time to the curriculum that is outlined. You'll find it incredibly useful in your daily recruiting.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-21:text-4",
    "page_id": 21,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.925,
      0.777,
      0.984,
      0.983
    ],
    "text": "\\- Melinda D.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-22:text-1",
    "page_id": 22,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.046,
      0.013,
      0.277,
      0.833
    ],
    "text": "\"Focus on \"Best Practices\" ofusing LinkedIn Recruiter. There are several ways of performing an action in LinkedIn Recruiter,but the optimal way is what you need to learn.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-22:text-2",
    "page_id": 22,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.328,
      0.013,
      0.383,
      0.175
    ],
    "text": "\\- Vikas K.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-22:text-3",
    "page_id": 22,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.578,
      0.248,
      0.829,
      0.989
    ],
    "text": "“The exam is based on the entire recruiting   \nlife cycle. Understanding how to effectively search the network is just as important as knowing how to post a job.\"",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-22:text-4",
    "page_id": 22,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.876,
      0.82,
      0.935,
      0.986
    ],
    "text": "\\- Emily B.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-23:text-1",
    "page_id": 23,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.461,
      0.106,
      0.55,
      0.893
    ],
    "text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-24:text-1",
    "page_id": 24,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.097,
      0.148,
      0.215,
      0.863
    ],
    "text": "What happens to my certification with the rollout of Next-Gen Recruiter?",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-24:text-2",
    "page_id": 24,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.35,
      0.054,
      0.687,
      0.932
    ],
    "text": "Your certification willbe valid for two years after passing.   \nEven though there willbea change to the Recruiter tool,   \nthe main subjects and objectives of the exam will remain the same.Most of the existing certification exam   \nquestions will remain relevant in the next generation of Recruiter.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-25:text-1",
    "page_id": 25,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.095,
      0.091,
      0.196,
      0.917
    ],
    "text": "Next-Gen Recruiter seems to eliminate the need for Boolean Search, will there stillbe questions about this?",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-25:text-2",
    "page_id": 25,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.263,
      0.078,
      0.465,
      0.936
    ],
    "text": "Yes.While next-gen Recruiter will allow for efficient searching   \nwithout knowledge of Booleanmodifiers,understanding how to construct accurate Boolean search strings remains a fundamental skill for all talent acquisition professionals.   \nKnowledge of Booleanmodifiersmayno longerbe required to   \nperformaneffective search,but test takersshould have that knowledge.Everyday knowledge of the tool will not be   \nsufficient to pass the exam.Trulyadvanced Recruiter users will understand and leverage Boolean searching.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-26:text-1",
    "page_id": 26,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.095,
      0.052,
      0.265,
      0.928
    ],
    "text": "Not all recruiting organizations use Linkedln job postings or Recruiter job slots. Why are questions about these capabilities included on the exam?",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-26:text-2",
    "page_id": 26,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.394,
      0.045,
      0.736,
      0.947
    ],
    "text": "Linkedln recognizes that while you may not currently be using job postings or job slots,organizations must be able to react quickly andflexiblytochanging business needs.Requiringyoutoknow howto effectively display jobs to potential candidates ensures that theLinkedln Certified Professional-Recruitercertificationwill be relevant in the overallrecruiting industryasa foundational skill set,nowand in the future.",
    "source_type": "text"
  },
  {
    "layout_id": "page-27:text-1",
    "page_id": 27,
    "layout_type": "text",
    "asset_ref": null,
    "bbox_norm": [
      0.463,
